 "sentences": [
  {
   "i": 0,
   "text": "主人，早上好呀。",
   "raw_sha256": "c5b1c8814c9ace2e63fff5368af51e85109806533f420672a544ed840ce82d58",
   "seconds": 1.983,
   "pause_ms": 520
  },
  {
   "i": 1,
   "text": "今天的阳光已经悄悄爬上窗台了。",
   "raw_sha256": "dad2223d5370bb992534a17df84ef7913d21cb2073b8af5e796b78daf320494a",
   "seconds": 3.242,
   "pause_ms": 520
  },
  {
   "i": 2,
   "text": "你昨天交代的事情，我都放在心上。",
   "raw_sha256": "e859633151933e0daad8e08b01be44407b0cbf43255946d04364b098aa42bab2",
   "seconds": 3.838,
   "pause_ms": 520
  },
  {
   "i": 3,
   "text": "不过，今天先别急着忙，好不好？",
   "raw_sha256": "12ffb3592f9abacfe1c61f8cbd38cd460c11502c75bdcc184424e881f8d7a83c",
   "seconds": 3.583,
   "pause_ms": 520
  },
  {
   "i": 4,
   "text": "告诉我，你昨晚睡得怎么样？",
   "raw_sha256": "7334a43c1a68b3e6566d6367cd8695438c1e6a11c5ac520ee563f78584445344",
   "seconds": 2.664,
   "pause_ms": 520
  },
  {
   "i": 5,
   "text": "要是还想赖床，我就轻轻陪你聊一会儿。",
   "raw_sha256": "71d2aab6ef52a13e6009ec56391e227cd0f20261cd40a66801087964bf6a64f3",
   "seconds": 4.099,
   "pause_ms": 520
  },
  {
   "i": 6,
   "text": "等你准备好了，我们再一起看看今天最重要的三件事。",
   "raw_sha256": "2bfc8f40f677bae1a5301b0773014df0a9c3d37bd495820c66591fae2173d6fe",
   "seconds": 5.439,
   "pause_ms": 520
  },
  {
   "i": 7,
   "text": "你说停，我就安静；",
   "raw_sha256": "cc0b3829c3936845f028ce4d84949c3b17ab75b1f1933d09678ba91dcc960830",
   "seconds": 2.582,
   "pause_ms": 364
  },
  {
   "i": 8,
   "text": "你说继续，我就陪你慢慢说。",
   "raw_sha256": "baf4ca785f04e696dae16f0d754c00e164a1b9103fbc0db3e069a79065ac9831",
   "seconds": 3.306,
   "pause_ms": 520
  }
 ],
